lenging survival, resource management, and environmental threats.Advanced Traps & Defenses – More creative ways to prepare, trap, and outsmart werewolves.Hunter Classes & Abilities – Unique skills, deeper progression, and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:52:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691238","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4426920-1846651706685474","game_id":"steam-4426920","kind":"announcement","title":"THE HUNT BEGINS THIS MONDAY!","summary":"Hunters, get ready!The wait is almost over! On October 19th, the free demo of Werewolf Hunter: Night of Horror launches on Steam as part of Steam Next Fest!Gather your friends, prepare your equipment, and step into a dark, dangerous world where every night could be your last.But remember: You're not just trying to survive. You're here to hunt!What awaits you in the demo?6 Different Werewolf TypesEncounter terrifying werewolves, each with its own behavior! Unlock them by beating them down in the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T19:52:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685474","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4426920-1834602721184897","game_id":"steam-4426920","kind":"announcement","title":"Werewolf Hunter: Core Gameplay","summary":"Werewolf Hunter – Gameplay OverviewWerewolf Hunter is a co-op survival horror game where you do not blindly hunt a monster. First, you have to understand what you are dealing with.Investigate. Analyze. Prepare. Hunt. Kill.1. Gear Up and PrepareIn Werewolf Hunter, every round starts inside a randomly placed container where you prepare for the mission. Choose your equipment, coordinate with your team, and decide who takes which tools.After that, you leave the safe zone and begin the investigation.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T13:55:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721184897","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4426920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4426920":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4426920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z"},"4727920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T12:29:00Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4426920","app_id":4426920,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"e3b7cef474c956952aa7ce8e9678bbd82c427fb636c7772558a3e954359336a1","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Werewolf Hunter is a survival horror game about tracking a deadly predator in a hostile wilderness. Manage hunger and thirst, collect DNA to uncover its weakness, set traps, and barricade shelters. Hunt a regenerating beast that grows more dangerous with every night.","publishers":[{"name":"CROWFORGE Games","creator_clan_account_id":45787439}],"developers":[{"name":"CROWFORGE Games","creator_clan_account_id":45787439}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":t